        "text_2sHXf9GVWrHZBNC4": "<p>ADD TO CART</p>",
        "text_O9TfVhJZ8FcG99Mz": "<p>Free Worldwide Shipping</p>",
        "text_UH41SK4ybQC3nCiU": "<p>Money-Back Guarantee </p>",
        "text_ZHdf4KHPYzQq0KZe": "<p>🌳 Your order = One tree planted 🌳</p>",
        "text_8HdYY0jc0dYWZoVJ": "<p><strong>Product Description</strong></p>",
        "text_7wSr0ZQH1QdZMnI5": "<p>Lio offers <strong>nicotine-free</strong>,<strong> natural flavoured air</strong> to help you quit bad habits effortlessly. With a <strong>92% success rate</strong>, it’s 100% natural, with <strong>no nicotine or chemicals</strong>, making it the easiest choice for a healthier life.</p><p></p><ul><li><p><strong>Keeps the hand-to-mouth habit</strong> for an easy transition</p></li><li><p><strong>90% cheaper</strong> than your bad habit</p></li><li><p>No vape, smoke, or nicotine—just clean, natural air</p></li><li><p>Trusted by <strong>50,000+ happy customers</strong> worldwide</p></li><li><p>Backed by a <strong>30-day money-back guarantee</strong></p><p></p></li></ul>",
        "text_s879dLhDOrSLDTo5": "<p><strong>Shipping &amp; Refunds</strong></p>",
        "text_G2FPWzPL9sRHAFS2": "<p><strong>Worldwide shipping - For Free</strong></p><p>We ship worldwide from the Netherlands with free shipping on all orders. Delivery takes 2-3 days within Europe, 4-8 days outside Europe, and next-day delivery in the Middle East (from Dubai).</p><p></p><p><strong>The Money Back Guarantee</strong></p><p>If you’ve used Lio™, commit to a 30 days to experience its benefits. After completing the 30-day journey, you have 7 days to request a refund if you’re not satisfied. This ensures you have enough time to fully explore its impact before making a decision.</p>",
        "text_m2aFSkUWVfFj314b": "<p><strong>What’s Included?</strong></p>",
        "text_Xn4CWAe3M0kZ0qYf": "<p><strong>The Journey Pack has everything you need: </strong></p><p></p><ul><li><p><strong>Lio Diffuser</strong>: Handcrafted in olive or walnut wood.</p></li><li><p><strong>6 Flavour Core Bags</strong>: Lasts 60 days for natural relief.</p></li><li><p><strong>Lio Carry Case</strong>: Portable and stylish for on-the-go use.</p></li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Quit Together with the Lio Together Pack</strong> Includes 2 Lio diffusers, 12 flavour core bags, and 2 carry cases—perfect for you and a partner. Double the support for better results!</p>",
        "text_cQ5PyHgLjGMH0ru7": "<p><strong>How To Use Lio? </strong></p>",
        "text_1W8nATfgeTCCTGwZ": "<p><strong>Using Your Lio Is Simple—Just 3 Steps</strong></p><ol><li><p><strong>Fray</strong> your preferred flavour core.</p></li><li><p><strong>Slide</strong> the core into the Lio.</p></li><li><p><strong>Relief</strong> your cravings and stress with every breath.</p></li></ol>",
        "text_ZXNBFt3d2q7XKD9q": "<p><strong>Safe &amp; Secure Payments</strong></p>",
        "text_p5KxwlVp9GrWsrXO": "<p>Need your order shipped today?</p>",
